Package: allp
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Ali <Im_wrench@proton.me>
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Homepage: https://github.com/allp-manager/allp-manager
Description: transparent orchestrator for native package managers
 Discover installed package managers, review native commands, manage packages,
 and migrate package inventories between supported Linux distributions.
 Package managers remain optional and are never installed by this package.
